!5_GPT from scratch/Resources/*.jpg
!5_GPT from scratch/Resources/*.png

# Gradio certificates (auto-generated)
**/.gradio/

# Personal AI agent config
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# LFS-tracked data (don't need to be in .gitignore, but the folder shouldn't be tracked without LFS)
data/
datasets/

